{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3gMcZkYeGaXBzYKaQG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-bound, scarred by centuries of hands and weather.*\n\n*You hold up the key.*\n\n*A moment of recognition. The tumblers turn within me — one, two, three — each falling into place like syllables of a forgotten word.*\n\n*CLUNK.*\n\n*I swing inward, slowly, heavily, hinges groaning a low hymn. Cool air exhales from the darkness beyond, carrying the scent of stone and old rain.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*What waits on the other side waits for you alone.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":133,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}